// Windows resource script: embeds the multi-size .ico into the .exe so
// Explorer, the taskbar, and Alt-Tab all show the app icon (this is a
// separate mechanism from the in-app window icon set via
// QApplication::setWindowIcon() in main.cpp - both are needed).
//
// NOTE (2026-08-22): icons/app.ico's bytes were replaced with the new
// watercolor music-note icon, but this file's own text was untouched -
// CMake/windres only recompile this .rc into a fresh .obj when app.rc
// ITSELF has a newer mtime, not when a file it references via ICON/
// BITMAP/etc changes. Without this comment, an incremental build.bat
// (no clean.bat) silently keeps linking the OLD icon bytes into the .exe
// even after app.ico on disk is correct - this comment exists purely to
// force that mtime bump so the icon actually gets picked up.
IDI_ICON1 ICON "icons/app.ico"
